    <!-- PART 4 -->
    <section class="part" id="part-tech" aria-labelledby="h-tech">
      <div class="part-eyebrow"><i data-lucide="cpu" width="13" height="13" aria-hidden="true"></i>Part 4</div>
      <h2 id="h-tech">The Technology, in Plain Language</h2>
      <p>Understanding what powers Vinifera requires no computer science background. Here is how each component fits together, described by what it does rather than what it is called.</p>

      <div class="tech-grid" aria-label="Technology stack">
        <div class="tech-card">
          <div class="tech-card-label">Interface</div>
          <h4>React + Tailwind CSS</h4>
          <p>The industry standard for fast, responsive web apps. The Wine/Gold palette, rounded card layouts, and navigation are all Tailwind tokens.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-card">
          <div class="tech-card-label">Database</div>
          <h4>Supabase (PostgreSQL)</h4>
          <p>Used by Instagram and Spotify. Row-Level Security enforces that Winery A can never see Winery B's data — enforced at the database layer, not just the application.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-card">
          <div class="tech-card-label">Payments</div>
          <h4>Stripe</h4>
          <p>Powers both winery subscription fees and per-member shipment billing. Handles decline logic, card updates, and fraud detection. Vinifera stores no card data.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-card">
          <div class="tech-card-label">Email</div>
          <h4>Resend</h4>
          <p>Transactional email delivery with DKIM/SPF authentication so pre-shipment and payment decline messages reach inboxes, not spam folders.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-card">
          <div class="tech-card-label">Hosting</div>
          <h4>Cloudflare Pages</h4>
          <p>Production infrastructure used by Shopify and Discord. 330+ global data centers. 99.99% uptime commitment. Not a prototyping environment.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-card">
          <div class="tech-card-label">Compliance</div>
          <h4>ShipCompliant</h4>
          <p>Industry-standard alcohol shipping compliance API. Verifies state-by-state legality, calculates tax, and generates compliance reports for every shipment.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-card">
          <div class="tech-card-label">Monitoring</div>
          <h4>PostHog + Sentry</h4>
          <p>PostHog tracks how operators use the product. Sentry captures software errors the moment they occur and alerts the dev team before customers notice.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tech-card">
          <div class="tech-card-label">Authentication</div>
          <h4>Supabase Auth</h4>
          <p>JWT-based sessions with magic-link for members and password/OAuth for staff. Two separate auth surfaces — admin portal and member portal — with different security models.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

